{"title":"Footpad","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 7 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/footpad\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>23</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/footpad?lv=6\" title=\"Pick level 6\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 